    {
      "id": "https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/2026/09/22/oakland-california-trip-report/",
      "url": "https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/2026/09/22/oakland-california-trip-report/",
      "title": "[Kagi Small Web] Oakland, California trip report",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.11.17-scaled.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.11.17-scaled.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yesterday on this blog <a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/2026/09/21/piedmont-california-trip-report/\">we highlighted Piedmont, California</a>, which is 0.8% Black and 3.8% Latinx. Today we look at diversity-is-our-strength Oakland.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Folks in Oakland seem to have a lot more sex. &#8220;Cheated On? freeSTDcheck.org&#8221;:</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.11.17-scaled.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65483\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.11.17-1138x1520.jpg\" width=\"1138\" /></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-14.46.42-scaled.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65484\" height=\"1140\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-14.46.42-1520x1140.jpg\" width=\"1520\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Oakland is a center for <a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/2023/06/20/rainbow-first-retail-examples-from-bozeman-montana/\">Rainbow-first retail</a>. Before one can spend $6 on a coffee, for example, one must walk underneath the sacred flag:</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.09.16-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65486\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.09.16-1140x1520.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.12.10-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65485\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.12.10-1140x1520-1.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Who are the customers for $6 coffees? Quite a few undocumented immigrants, it seems, because the coffee shop is officially a place where migrant customers are safe from ICE thugs. (I didn&#8217;t see a bathroom for customers, so I&#8217;m not sure just how long a noble undocumented migrant could stay, as a purely practical matter.)</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.09.11-scaled.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65487\" height=\"1140\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.09.11-1520x1140.jpg\" style=\"width: 654px; height: auto;\" width=\"1520\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">What passion goes hand-in-glove with Rainbow Flag worship? Pro-Hamas advocacy. The windows next to the door of Walden Pond Books.</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.05.38-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65493\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.05.38-1140x1520-1.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.05.43-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65491\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.05.43-1140x1520-1.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.05.33-scaled.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65492\" height=\"1140\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.05.33-1520x1140.jpg\" width=\"1520\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">What&#8217;s in the bookstore? Books celebrating a Hamas-/Palestinian Islamic Jihad-ruled &#8220;Free Palestine&#8221; with a Rainbow Flag in the background:</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-14.59.04-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65494\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-14.59.04-1140x1520.jpg\" style=\"width: 620px; height: auto;\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Detail:</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-14.58.30-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65495\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-14.58.30-1140x1520.jpg\" style=\"width: 547px; height: auto;\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Who among us is obstructing the glorious day when Free Palestine arrives? If we could only &#8220;catch a fascist&#8221; we, and our Palestinian brothers, sisters, and binary-resisters, might yet be okay.</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-14.59.47-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65496\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-14.59.47-1140x1520.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.00.43-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65497\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.00.43-1140x1520-1.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">What language would people speak in Free Palestine? &#8220;Queer Arabic&#8221;:</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.03.43-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65501\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.03.43-1140x1520-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 604px; height: auto;\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Were they any tutorials available on how to be queer? So glad that you asked! You can learn how to cook &#8220;Queer Food&#8221; from <em><a href=\"https://amzn.to/4yAvqRk\">Queers at the Table</a></em> and put in on a table that is an example of <em><a href=\"https://amzn.to/4j9tsmn\">Queer X Design</a></em>.</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-5 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.03.35-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65512\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.03.35-1140x1520-1.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.04.24-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65511\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.04.24-1140x1520-1.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">How different are readers&#8217; tastes in California vs. the national average? Prominently featured <em>Queers at the Table</em> has just two Amazon reviews is &#8220;#753,447 in Books&#8221;. <em>Queer X Design</em> is significantly more popular: &#8220;#343,353 in Books&#8221;.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">What about some after-dinner reading? <a href=\"https://amzn.to/4cTCXlU\"><em>Hijab Butch Blues</em></a>:</p>\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A queer hijabi Muslim immigrant survives her coming-of-age by drawing strength and hope from stories in the Quran &#8230; Through personal experiences, Lamya H navigates the complexities of gender, sexuality and faith as a queer, nonbinary Muslim.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-6 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.02.58-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65515\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.02.58-1140x1520-1.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.03.04-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65513\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.03.04-1140x1520-1.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.03.17-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65516\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.03.17-1140x1520-1.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.03.57-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65514\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.03.57-1140x1520-1.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">What kind of people want to pay full price for books in the English language? Undocumented migrants who will presumably be shielded from ICE by the merchant:</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.05.49-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65517\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.05.49-1140x1520-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 438px; height: auto;\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">What if you&#8217;re planning to head up the hill to Piedmont and need to agitate against the construction of affordable housing? You can prep by reading <em><a href=\"https://amzn.to/4xt0XDy\">Golden Gates</a></em>, regarding the &#8220;housing crisis&#8221; that in no conceivable way could have been caused by importing at least 70 million humans (more than the current population of France), mostly low-skill, over the past 50 years. </p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.01.08-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65518\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.01.08-1140x1520.jpg\" style=\"width: 453px; height: auto;\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Criminals don&#8217;t tend to either Black or Latinx, but the bookstore says that you should buy &#8220;Books on Black, Latinx &#8230; history and culture&#8221; for people who are current incarcerated.</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-7 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-14.57.52-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65522\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-14.57.52-1140x1520-1.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.01.22-scaled-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-65521\" height=\"1520\" src=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-09-02-15.01.22-1140x1520-1.jpg\" width=\"1140\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog/2026/09/22/oakland-california-trip-report/\">Oakland, California trip report</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://philip.greenspun.com/blog\">Philip Greenspun’s Weblog</a>.</p>",
